@startuml CryptoWeb-state-02-kyc-application
title CryptoWeb - KYC Application Lifecycle

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "NOT_SUBMITTED" as NotSubmitted
state "PENDING" as Pending
state "APPROVED" as Approved
state "REJECTED" as Rejected

[*] --> NotSubmitted : registration creates application
NotSubmitted --> Pending : submit valid verification details
Rejected --> Pending : correct details and resubmit
Pending --> Approved : administrator approves
Pending --> Rejected : administrator rejects

note right of NotSubmitted
  Identity documents may be uploaded
  before formal submission without
  changing application status.
end note

note right of Pending
  A pending application cannot be
  submitted again. Only pending
  applications can be reviewed.
end note

note right of Approved
  The approval operation also
  activates the user's wallet.
end note

@enduml
